# `printWidth` is 120 because that is how this codebase is actually written -
# 85 files failed `format:check` against the old value of 100 while nothing in
# src/ had been reformatted. Setting the width to match the code, rather than
# reformatting 85 files in a tooling pass, was the deliberate choice: a
# reformat diff would have buried every substantive fix in that pass under
# whitespace.
#
# The flip side is that `format:check` is NOT in `verify` and NOT blocking in
# CI - it runs there with `continue-on-error` so the remaining drift is visible
# instead of invisible. 43 files still hold at least one line longer than 120
# characters, so the check cannot be made blocking until one `npm run format`
# pass has been reviewed and committed on its own.
#
# This file is the only place that rationale can live: `.prettierrc.json` is
# strict JSON and prettier's JSON parser rejects comments outright.